WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:02.768
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING, CHEERING)
-Hello, we're back on Overtime.

00:00:02.768 --> 00:00:04.603
We've got filmmaker
of the HBO documentary,

00:00:04.737 --> 00:00:07.306
<i>The Insurrectionist Next Door,</i>
Alexandra Pelosi.

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:10.343
We have<i> New York Times</i> columnist
Bret Stephens,

00:00:10.476 --> 00:00:13.246
and we have CNN contributor
and democratic strategist,

00:00:13.446 --> 00:00:15.147
-Paul Begala.
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING, CHEERING)

00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:17.851
And these are the questions
hot off the press.

00:00:18.984 --> 00:00:21.287
I hold in my hand... (LAUGHS)

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:24.824
...one night I should
just do Carnac
and fuck with their minds.

00:00:24.991 --> 00:00:28.395
Should Rashida Tal--
Oh, oh, yes. Hmm.

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:31.364
Should Rashida Talib,
who by the way,

00:00:31.631 --> 00:00:33.099
still has not acknowledged

00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:35.468
that the missile
that killed the hospital

00:00:35.601 --> 00:00:38.337
was not an Israeli missile,
still telling the lie.

00:00:38.671 --> 00:00:39.872
Be for--
Should she be forced

00:00:40.006 --> 00:00:42.275
to take down
the Palestinian flag

00:00:42.609 --> 00:00:45.612
flying outside her office.
Yeah, I saw that picture.

00:00:45.778 --> 00:00:47.213
Oh, there you have it--

00:00:47.346 --> 00:00:49.148
-BRET STEPHENS: No,
the answer is no.
-PAUL BEGALA: No.

00:00:49.281 --> 00:00:51.785
Yeah, I mean,
I despise her political views,

00:00:51.918 --> 00:00:53.586
but absolutely not.
She's an American.

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:54.821
She can do whatever she wants.

00:00:54.987 --> 00:00:56.589
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)
-BILL MAHER: But--

00:00:56.723 --> 00:01:01.026
-Okay.
-And I mean, and I--

00:01:01.093 --> 00:01:02.328
-you know where I'm coming from.
-But, I mean,

00:01:02.462 --> 00:01:04.630
the American Congress.
Has this been done before?

00:01:04.764 --> 00:01:05.865
Do other people-- do like the--

00:01:05.999 --> 00:01:07.600
I mean, people come
from different countries.

00:01:07.733 --> 00:01:08.868
Do they then fly the f--

00:01:09.102 --> 00:01:10.503
I mean, there's plenty of people

00:01:10.703 --> 00:01:12.772
I'm sure who have
heritage from Mexico.

00:01:12.905 --> 00:01:15.407
Do they put the Mexican flag
outside their office?

00:01:15.541 --> 00:01:16.475
It's-- It's--

00:01:16.609 --> 00:01:18.244
I think voters should make
judgments

00:01:18.377 --> 00:01:21.080
about her political choices,
but I think it's the essence

00:01:21.213 --> 00:01:22.582
-of a democracy...
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

00:01:22.715 --> 00:01:24.717
...that you can fly the flags
that you want--

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:26.919
BILL: Where do you--
Where do you stand on this one?

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:29.989
-I'm not touching that.
-BILL: You're not touching that?

00:01:30.123 --> 00:01:31.057
-Come on.
-BILL: Oh, you are afraid

00:01:31.191 --> 00:01:32.291
-to get cancelled.
-But-- But--

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:34.227
-BRET: What does your mom think?
-Wait, but here's the thing.

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:36.362
I will go into-- I support
the whole concept

00:01:36.496 --> 00:01:39.031
of free speech, right?
And one of the main things

00:01:39.165 --> 00:01:40.165
I talk about
in my movie is about

00:01:40.299 --> 00:01:42.167
when does free speech
become hate speech?

00:01:42.334 --> 00:01:44.336
-BILL: Mm-hmm.
-And when do we go after people,

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:45.938
and call it hate speech.
This was where the whole thing

00:01:46.071 --> 00:01:47.239
about getting cancelled
comes from.

00:01:47.373 --> 00:01:48.808
Like, "I'm afraid to talk
about that

00:01:48.941 --> 00:01:50.209
because I don't wanna get
cancelled."

00:01:50.342 --> 00:01:51.844
That's-- "People are gonna say
it's hate speech--"

00:01:51.977 --> 00:01:53.246
BILL: Well, what-- Okay.

00:01:53.579 --> 00:01:55.147
BRET:
Why don't we just call it...

00:01:55.281 --> 00:01:56.516
-BILL: Yeah?
-..."shitty speech"?

00:01:56.649 --> 00:01:58.618
BILL: Yeah. I'm not--

00:01:58.751 --> 00:02:01.320
It's in the eye of the--
Hate speech is a concept

00:02:01.454 --> 00:02:02.922
that's always in the eye
of the beholder.

00:02:03.056 --> 00:02:04.023
-BILL: I agree.
-PAUL: Hate speech is

00:02:04.157 --> 00:02:06.025
speech that I hate.
So, don't say anything

00:02:06.158 --> 00:02:07.092
-I disagree with.
-ALEXANDRA PELOSI: But

00:02:07.226 --> 00:02:08.194
there's this whole thing
called free speech,

00:02:08.328 --> 00:02:09.495
but who cares
if nobody's listening.

00:02:09.629 --> 00:02:12.064
We're not listening
to each other, so who cares.

00:02:12.197 --> 00:02:15.401
(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

00:02:15.535 --> 00:02:17.736
I've never been in love
with the concept

00:02:17.870 --> 00:02:20.840
of looking into people's minds
when they commit crimes.

00:02:21.107 --> 00:02:23.242
It's a crime,
you need to pay for it.

00:02:23.376 --> 00:02:26.445
If it-- If you committed
the crime, why you did it,

00:02:26.579 --> 00:02:27.547
I don't know.

00:02:27.814 --> 00:02:30.182
That gets in the crazy kind
of territory of thought crimes--

00:02:30.316 --> 00:02:31.417
-BRET: Right.
-Which is--

00:02:31.551 --> 00:02:32.985
Which is exactly
where we don't wanna go.

00:02:33.119 --> 00:02:37.056
But, yeah. No, I agree.
She can fly the flag anywhere.

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:40.526
But what does it say
about, you know, you're--

00:02:40.659 --> 00:02:41.961
It just seems like you're--

00:02:42.094 --> 00:02:44.096
The loyalties are
a little too divided--

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:45.764
I agree,
and let the voters of Michigan

00:02:45.898 --> 00:02:47.232
draw their conclusions
next year.

00:02:47.366 --> 00:02:49.435
I know how I would vote
if I were in her district,

00:02:49.569 --> 00:02:51.670
but, absolutely,

00:02:51.804 --> 00:02:54.307
I'm gonna stand up for her right
to speak her mind.

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:56.809
Okay, what do you think
of Putin's meeting with Xi,

00:02:56.942 --> 00:02:59.912
that's right, Putin of Russia,
and Xi of China.

00:03:00.179 --> 00:03:04.216
