-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:03:06.185 --> 00:03:07.720
(LAUGHS)

00:03:08.921 --> 00:03:11.691
-(CHUCKLES)
-(CHUCKLES) One says,

00:03:12.225 --> 00:03:14.560
