Okay, good. I'm with you buddy.

00:03:35.481 --> 00:03:36.616 line:0%
-But they love Putin.
-(BILL CHUCKLING)

00:03:36.749 --> 00:03:38.183 line:0%
By the way,
Putin was meeting with--

00:03:38.317 --> 00:03:40.352
